Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent optometrists around {City}. {Business Name} has loyal reviews and great frames, but no way to book an eye exam online and nowhere to browse eyewear before a visit, which is exactly where chains win.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: eye exam booking by type, a frames gallery by style, contact lens reordering, a vision benefits page and a children's eye exam page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain your practice owns and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. You approve every page. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
